      "latency": 5529,
      "token_count": null,
      "status": "200 OK",
      "player_input": "I address a bystander who is actually here, not \"for any hostile threat\". My words stay: I scan for any hostile threat before committing — if none is present, I stay alert and choose a safer scene action.",
      "ai_response": "The air in the \"Entry\" of the Sevenfold Circle is thick with the scent of ozone and dust, a sharp contrast to the lingering memory of your old world. Shouts echo from the street outside, muffled by stone but insistent, punctuated by the distant rumble of something heavy. You look towards the two figures who were present when you arrived. One, a man in what appears to be official-looking garb, stands near the doorway leading further into the building, his face set in a grim line. The other, a woman whose clothes seem practical and worn, watches the street with a sharp, assessing gaze. Neither of them moves to intercept your words as you speak, their attention seemingly divided between you and the chaotic sounds from beyond the stone walls.\n\n\"I scan for any hostile threat before committing,\" you state, your voice cutting through the low hum of unease, \"if none is present, I stay alert and choose a safer scene action.\"\n\nThe man in official garb, whom you've identified as a Warden by his bearing and the faint insignia on his tunic, turns his gaze towards you. He doesn't immediately answer your query about threats, his eyes sweeping over you with a mixture of weariness and professional assessment. \"The threat is the war, girl,\" he finally says, his voice raspy, \"and it's outside. The King's men are dealing with it. What matters to us is understanding why *you* are here.\" He gestures with a thumb towards the doorway. \"And whether you're going to help or hinder.\"\n\n1. Ask the Warden what he means by \"why you are here.\"\n2. Ask the woman if she's seen any immediate dangers inside the building.\n3. Examine the doorway leading further into the building.\n4. Step back and continue observing the street sounds.",
      "error_stack": null,
      "save_id": "22a4f976-fc6f-467c-9af7-6927eaefd5d5"
    },
    {
      "id": "df755c5a-1b80-4e9c-953d-7f3646ba57a5",
      "created_at": "2026-08-29T11:50:36.116859+00:00",
