      "token_count": null,
      "status": "200 OK",
      "player_input": "Ask what is going on",
      "ai_response": "The world coalesces around you with the jarring finality of a dropped anvil. One moment, the mundane reality of your Earthly existence; the next, the guttural roar of distant explosions and the acrid bite of smoke filling your lungs. You stand on a circular mosaic of cracked stone, the air vibrating with the concussive force of impacts not far away. Jagged cracks spiderweb across the ancient tiles beneath your feet, and the sky above is a bruised canvas of smoke and fire. Around you, a scattered group of individuals in varying states of disarray begin to stir, their eyes wide with a mixture of terror and confusion, murmuring amongst themselves about the sudden shift in reality. A figure in ornate, but torn, ceremonial robes kneels nearby, clutching a broken staff.\n\n\"What is happening?\" you ask, your voice feeling strangely distant in the cacophony.\n\nThe robed figure looks up, their eyes wide and unfocused as if struggling to grasp the enormity of the situation. \"The ritual... it has gone awry,\" they stammer, their voice raspy. \"The Sevenfold Circle is supposed to be a place of sanctuary, a nexus point... but the bombardment... it has fractured the veil. You have been pulled through from... elsewhere. And so have others.\" They gesture vaguely at the stunned individuals beginning to gather their bearings. \"We are caught between worlds, and the war outside... it does not care for our plight.\"\n\n1. Ask the robed figure who they are and what the \"ritual\" was.\n2. Look around at the other stunned individuals who were also seemingly pulled through.\n3. Inspect your own clothes and the bag to see if anything has changed.\n4. Cautiously approach the edge of the circular mosaic to get a better look at the surrounding area.",
      "error_stack": null,
      "save_id": "22a4f976-fc6f-467c-9af7-6927eaefd5d5"
    },
