      "ai_response": "The rasp of hurried footsteps echoes from the alleyway, punctuated by sharp, urgent calls. A burly figure, clad in the utilitarian grey of the Meridian Clearance Authority, emerges from the narrow gap between two buildings, his hand resting on the butt of a sidearm holstered at his hip. He scans the small gathering with narrowed eyes, his gaze flicking from the cracked pavement to the nearby debris, before settling on you. \"You,\" he barks, his voice rough, \"The ones who don't look like they belong. Who's waiting?\" He gestures vaguely with his chin towards the direction he came from, implying the alley.\n\n1. Gesture towards the alleyway and ask for clarification.\n2. Stand your ground and demand to know who *he* is.\n3. Look around for an escape route.\n4. Remain silent and observe.",
